<title>SPAIN: Spain May investment funds rise to 22.73 tln pta.</title>
<headline>Spain May investment funds rise to 22.73 tln pta.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish investment funds rose to total 22.73 trillion pesetas at the end of May, up 0.71 trillion pesetas from the previous month, the association of investment and pension funds (Inverco) said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The rise was due to new savings and higher market prices.</p>
<p>In the last 12 months investment funds rose by 8.1 trillion pesetas, or 55 percent.</p>
<p>The number of investors rose to 5,373,946 with 124,864 news investors during May.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
</text>
